Upstream sources this tree derives from.

- https://github.com/2genkidev/buusfury, a disassembly of Dragon Ball Z: Buu's
  Fury. The revision cc53d0cd2d1c167e749419187e2d92017ac07468 is the base of
  asm/, assets/, build.bat, scatter.ld, src/ and tools/incbin.bat.
- jcalg1 by Jeremy Collake, https://github.com/jeremycollake/jcalg1, MIT (see
  tools/compress/jcalg1/LICENSE). The compressor's MASM source is vendored
  under tools/compress/jcalg1/ and built by tools/compress/build.cmd; no
  compiled copy of it is distributed here.
- grit by Dylan Graham, https://github.com/DylanGraham/grit, used by build.bat
  and not distributed here.
- tools/webfoot/webfoot_lz.py is this project's Webfoot container codec, carried
  over from the reconstruction tree (tools/webfoot/formats/webfoot_lz.py). Its
  bit grammar is promoted from spicybung/DragonByteZ (MIT) and was verified
  against the canonical image.

No game image is distributed in this repository. The builder supplies the retail
ROM. This project is not affiliated with the rights holders of the game.
